  "description": "WE ARE PROPOSING TO REPLACE THE EXISTING GROUND FLOOR BAY WINDOW WITH A TIMBER SASH WINDOW, WHICH WOULD BE OF SIMILAR DESIGN AND APPEARANCE TO THE SASH WINDOW USED ON THE FIRST FLOOR AND OF SASH WINDOWS WHICH APPEAR ON THE SAME STREET. THE INTENTION IS THAT THE NEW TIMBER SASH WINDOW WILL BE MORE IN KEEPING WITH THE ORIGINAL FEATURES OF THE HOUSES IN THIS AREA. AN IMAGE IS ATTACHED WHICH SHOWS THE CURRENT APPEARANCE OF THE FRONT OF 1 LORNE ROAD, FOR REFERENCE. PLEASE ALSO REFER TO THE HERITAGE STATEMENT FOR FURTHER DETAILS IN RELATION TO THE SITE AND PROPOSED WORKS. ",
  "decision_conditions": [
